---
<Layout title="Travel | Janan & Ryan" description="Everything you need to plan your trip to Wellington, from visas to places to stay.">
  <div class="guide">
    <header class="hero">
      <h1>Travel</h1>
      <p>Everything you need to plan your trip to Wellington, from entry requirements and airport connections to a comfortable place to stay.</p>
      <div class="botanical-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </header>

    <section class="before-travel" aria-labelledby="before-travel-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="before-travel-heading">Before You Travel</h2><span aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
      <div class="travel-grid">
        <article><h3>Visitor visa</h3><p>Along with a valid passport, you’ll need the right permission to enter New Zealand. Most guests will be eligible for an NZeTA, which allows a stay of up to three months.</p><a href="https://www.immigration.govt.nz/visas/new-zealand-electronic-travel-authority-nzeta/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Check your NZeTA eligibility <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
        <article><h3>Flights and layovers</h3><p>You’ll likely fly into Auckland before continuing on a domestic flight to Wellington. The Auckland-to-Wellington flight is about an hour; leave plenty of time to transfer between the international and domestic terminals.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="arrival" aria-labelledby="arrival-heading">
      <div class="arrival-copy">
        <div class="title-with-icon"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><h2 id="arrival-heading">Arriving</h2></div>
        <p>Wellington Airport (WLG) is conveniently located just 15 minutes from the city centre. Taxis and ride-shares are readily available outside the terminal.</p>
        <div class="arrival-detail"><span aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><div><h3>Transport</h3><p>The Airport Express Bus ($9) departs every 20 minutes.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="arrival-image"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDCdUIoJyYF2dZnk_kDxRIPSzBxKGnt85tbk9ZXKVWbSyclF065dx0Qo2llkYZd1EBVNmzEUWAXvDMa2CVEbsngtgkYlSeJ8AYmJ7Danwco3JIyGEeDuZ8e_hRbiMdSwi5HOpKPcQBkC5OeP-vTf_IsgB3b3BpqwR5EUK9LYXAYfy_yykvK94Pgv2MViYsC8Ix9oJ7OWoxWzRqZWYs7NA-P0arMd3B6v7MxhZpSjkKnYFq0TeAk5IHKXg" alt="Wellington harbour viewed from Mount Victoria" /></div>
    </section>

    <section class="stays" aria-labelledby="stays-heading">
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="stays-heading">Places to Stay</h2><span aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
      <div class="stay-grid">{stays.map((stay) => <article class="stay-card"><div class="stay-image"><img src={stay.image} alt={`${stay.name} hotel`} loading="lazy" /></div><h3>{stay.name}</h3><p class="eyebrow">{stay.type} <i>•</i> {stay.area}</p><p>{stay.description}</p></article>)}</div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .guide{width:min(100% - 40px,1072px);margin:0 auto;padding:76px 0 128px}.hero{text-align:center;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 104px}.hero h1,.guide h2,.guide h3{font-family:var(--font-headline);color:var(--green)}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7.3vw,5.6rem);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0 0 20px}.hero>p{font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.botanical-divider{width:120px;height:24px;margin:28px auto 0;background:url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='120' height='24' viewBox='0 0 120 24' fill='none' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath d='M60 12C50 12 40 4 30 4C20 4 10 12 0 12' stroke='%23E6D4B8' stroke-width='1.5'/%3E%3Cpath d='M60 12C70 12 80 20 90 20C100 20 110 12 120 12' stroke='%23E6D4B8' stroke-width='1.5'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='60' cy='12' r='3' fill='%23E6D4B8'/%3E%3C/svg%3E") center/contain no-repeat}.before-travel{margin-bottom:116px}.travel-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px}.travel-grid article{padding:34px 32px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6d4b84d;box-shadow:0 10px 40px #0f5f4c0d}.travel-grid h3{font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.02;margin:0 0 14px}.travel-grid p,.arrival-copy>p,.stay-card>p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.55;margin:0}.travel-grid a{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;color:var(--green);font:700 .67rem/1.4 var(--font-label);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--gold);text-underline-offset:4px}.arrival{display:grid;grid-template-columns:5fr 7fr;gap:24px;align-items:stretch;margin-bottom:116px}.arrival-copy{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-height:360px;background:#fff;padding:48px 40px;border:1px solid #e6d4b84d;box-shadow:0 10px 40px #0f5f4c0d}.title-with-icon{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:23px}.title-with-icon span{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--green)}.guide h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.15rem);font-weight:500;line-height:1;margin:0}.arrival-detail{display:flex;gap:13px;margin-top:28px}.arrival-detail>span{font-size:.9rem;color:#72594f;padding-top:3px}.arrival-detail h3{font:700 .67rem/1 var(--font-label);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.11em;margin:0 0 5px}.arrival-detail p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.45;margin:0}.arrival-image{min-height:360px;overflow:hidden}.arrival-image img,.stay-image img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:42px}.section-heading span{display:block;width:60px;height:1px;margin-bottom:8px;background:var(--gold)}.stay-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px}.stay-card:nth-child(2){margin-top:48px}.stay-image{aspect-ratio:3/4;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:21px}.stay-card h3{font-size:2rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.02;margin:0 0 8px}.eyebrow{font-weight:700!important;font-size:.64rem!important;line-height:1.3!important;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#72594f!important;margin:0 0 14px!important}.eyebrow i{font-style:normal;color:var(--gold);padding:0 2px}@media (hover:hover){.stay-image img{transition:transform .7s ease}.stay-card:hover img{transform:scale(1.04)}}@media(max-width:760px){.guide{width:min(100% - 40px,560px);padding:55px 0 70px}.hero{margin-bottom:64px}.hero h1{font-size:3.7rem}.hero>p{font-size:1rem}.travel-grid,.arrival{grid-template-columns:1fr}.before-travel,.arrival{margin-bottom:75px}.travel-grid article{padding:30px 28px}.arrival-copy{min-height:auto;padding:34px 28px}.arrival-image{min-height:265px}.section-heading{margin-bottom:30px}.stay-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:44px}.stay-card:nth-child(2){margin-top:0}.stay-image{aspect-ratio:4/3}}@media(max-width:430px){.guide{width:min(100% - 32px,560px)}.hero h1{font-size:3.25rem}}
</style>
